abstract: >-
  Code, frozen experiment configurations, environment specifications, run-level
  machine-readable results, task-geometry summaries, and tests
  supporting a paired audit of full-catalog user-level differentially private federated
  recommendation. Third-party benchmark data are not redistributed.
